><br /></p><p style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:right;text-indent:0px;line-height:20px;margin:0px\"><br /><br /></p><p style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:right;text-indent:0px;line-height:24px;margin:0px\"><br /></p><p style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:right;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.2;margin:0px\">תודה,</p><p style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:right;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.2;margin:0px\"><b>חן קריספין</b></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Aptos;font-size:11pt\"><br /></p></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;min-width:280px\"></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);margin:0px auto;padding-top:10px;max-width:600px;min-width:280px\"><table id=\"x_x_x_table_2\" style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin-right:auto;margin-left:0px;width:578px;box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"direction:rtl;text-indent:0px;padding:10px 20px 10px 40px;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(0,0,0);width:600px;height:39.3333px\"><div style=\"direction:rtl;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br /></div><div style=\"direction:rtl;text-align:center;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a class=\"x_x_x_OWAAutoLink\" id=\"OWA7827b7de-cdf3-ec7d-a2e8-07fc519bb1ec\" href=\"https://wa.me/972547880897?text=Hello\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:left\"></a>  <a class=\"x_x_x_OWAAutoLink\" id=\"OWA6023a98e-6a2b-5b6c-d01f-38c610600e92\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/henkrispin\" style=\"margin:0px;text-align:left\"></a>  <a class=\"x_x_x_OWAAut